## Traumatic shock: a lot of damage in a short time

traumatic-shock-start = The pain overwhelms you - you are in shock!
traumatic-shock-start-others = { CAPITALIZE($name) } goes pale and collapses.
traumatic-shock-end = The shock wears off.
traumatic-shock-end-early = The shock lets go - you are yourself again.
traumatic-shock-examine = [color=yellow]{ CAPITALIZE(SUBJECT($target)) } { CONJUGATE-BE($target) } pale and shaking, in shock.[/color]

alerts-eternal-war-shock-name = Shock
alerts-eternal-war-shock-desc = Too much pain at once: you move slower, see poorly and shake. It will pass; adrenaline ends the shock at once, painkillers keep you out of it.
